# Alert routing config (ADR-0065 Q8) — the ONE place to set who receives alert emails.
# Read by dev compose (grafana `env_file`) and by deploy/helm/observability/install-lgtm.sh (production Grafana).
# Comma-separated list allowed. test@test.com is the owner's placeholder (2026-11-18) until the real address is known.
# SMTP credentials are NOT here: dev uses GRAFANA_SMTP_* in your shell (sending is off by default),
# production the Secret `grafana-alerting`.
ALERT_EMAIL_TO=test@test.com
